  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Resources Institute 2010-2012 - World Resources Institute 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">World Resources Institute 2010-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ej &#xF6;ronm&#xE4;rkt programst&#xF6;d till World Resouces Institute f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;rande av dess strategiska plan f 2008-12 genom ett ramavtal till vilket andra givare kan ansluta sig. Fokkus &#xE4;r p&#xE5; fattigdopmsbek&#xE4;mpning i ljuset av klimatf&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring,genom  kliamtpolicyutvecking, ekosystemtj&#xE4;nster, milj&#xF6;f&#xF6;rvaltning, gr&#xF6;na marknader och h&#xE5;llbara transporter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unearmarked Program support to World Resources Institute for implementation of the 2008-2012 strategic plan channeled through a Joint General Framework Agreement, in order to allow joining by other donors. Focus on poverty alleviation in the light of climate change through climate policy, ecosystem services, environmental governance, green markets and sustainable transport.</narrative>
  </description>
